            </note>
            <note corresp="#d58-f2" n="2" xml:id="d58-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed, but see footnote 2, <ref target="#pg1427">p. 1427</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d58-f3" n="3" xml:id="d58-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed; it told Cattier to proceed in
                    accordance with the proposals contained in Sigto 462 and Sigto 463 and
                    stated that the Department of State intended to make the basic documents
                    available to representatives of interested governments. (862A.10/2–2351)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
